      "content": "The game is awesome, it's the version of the game that is an insult. Microsoft went too far with their package nonsense. You don't get the game in its normal form but rather a protected form with no exe file, meaning no modding... Instant gaming should give this information for all Microsoft purchases. This is not owning your game basically."
